  "safety_invariants": [
    "Potable supply and reclaimed greywater never share a pressurised cross-tie in this demonstrator.",
    "Municipal backup, if ever proposed, is a separate professionally designed physical air-gap/backflow arrangement.",
    "No online sensor may substitute for the independent use-quality decision.",
    "No release on missing/stale/conflicted evidence, power loss, failed process barrier, invalid storage age or maintenance lockout.",
    "No untreated greywater overflow or process reject is assumed to be acceptable stormwater discharge."
